<title>USA: IES says 54.3 pct of shrs voted for merger.</title>
<headline>IES says 54.3 pct of shrs voted for merger.</headline>
<dateline>CEDAR RAPIDS, Iowa 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>IES Industries Inc said Monday that 54.3 percent of its outstanding shares voted to approve its proposed merger with WPL Holdings Inc and Interstate Power Co.</p>
<p>More than two-thirds of the shares voted approved the deal, the company said.</p>
<p>The reults from the September 5 sharheolder meeting were confirmed by CT Co, the official inspector of the election, IES said.</p>
<p>The merger is expected to close in the first half of 1997, after regulatory review, the company said.</p>
<p>--Reuters Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
